		{"id":"0000000000000001","type":"text","text":"# 🎬 Reel-to-Knowledge Pipeline — Live Progress\nLegend: 🟩 done · 🟧 in progress · ⬜ not started · 🟦 build phase (later)","x":-80,"y":-220,"width":1500,"height":100,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"0000000000000010","type":"text","text":"### 🟩 1. yt-dlp + ffmpeg — DONE\n**Where:** Hostinger VPS\n\nRan as root (no sudo), used `--break-system-packages` for pip.\n\n**Confirmed:** ffmpeg 6.1.1, yt-dlp 2026.08.19","x":-40,"y":0,"width":330,"height":260,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"0000000000000011","type":"text","text":"### 🟧 2. whisper.cpp\n**Where:** Hostinger VPS\n\nClone + build + download a small/base model.\n\n**Verify:** transcribe one local test audio file from the shell first.\n\n**Status:** up next.","x":330,"y":0,"width":330,"height":260,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"0000000000000012","type":"text","text":"### ⬜ 3. Telegram bot\n**Where:** Telegram app (@BotFather)\n\nCreate bot → get token → add as n8n credential.\n\n**Verify:** Telegram Trigger node authenticates.\n\n**Status:** not started, no dependency on 1/2.","x":700,"y":0,"width":330,"height":260,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"0000000000000013","type":"text","text":"### ⬜ 4. Gemini API credential\n**Where:** n8n credentials\n\nGet free API key (Google AI Studio) → add credential → model: **Gemini 2.5 Flash (free tier)**.\n\n**Why switched from Claude:** user needs $0 cost, personal use. Free tier: 1,500 req/day, no card.\n\n**Verify:** trivial text-only HTTP Request call succeeds.\n\n**Status:** not started, no dependency on 1/2/3.","x":1070,"y":0,"width":330,"height":260,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"0000000000000030","type":"text","text":"**Telegram Trigger**","x":-40,"y":390,"width":220,"height":100,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"0000000000000031","type":"text","text":"**IF has video?**\nfalse → reply \"send a reel\"","x":210,"y":390,"width":220,"height":100,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"0000000000000035","type":"text","text":"**ffmpeg**\nextract key frames","x":-40,"y":510,"width":220,"height":100,"color":"5"},
